+- **Trigger length** - The length of the pulses at TRIG and ACCENT: 1, 2, 5, 10, 20, 50, 100 or 200 ms. The default 1 ms is the standard for triggers and is all a drum module needs; pick a longer one for a module that wants a wider pulse. Whatever the length, every hit still gets its own rising edge. The setting is saved with the patch.
 
